## Conventions
<!-- package layout (com.skillslab.jspring.<domain>), naming (Service / Repository / Controller / DTO suffixes), imports (jakarta.* NOT javax.*), constructor injection only -->

## Testing
<!-- test framework: JUnit 5 — NEVER JUnit 4, NEVER javax.* test imports
