## Don't-Touch
<!-- Files Claude must never edit:
     - application-prod.properties
     - src/main/resources/db/migration/*.sql (use a new V<N+1>__description.sql instead)
     - pom.xml major version bumps without explicit approval -->

## Commands
<!-- Full test suite:   ./mvnw clean verify
     Just unit tests:   ./mvnw test
     Integration only:  ./mvnw verify -Pintegration
     Run locally:       ./mvnw spring-boot:run -->

## Escalation
<!-- When should Claude STOP and ask a human?
     - Schema changes (new migration file, altered column type)
